{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"难堪没让他少喜欢，可再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求。\",\n      \"key\": \"再多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼被珍惜，只是不再反复琢磨对方在不在意，也不逼自己什么都不求，愿意关心时就真心盼对方过得好。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心盼对方过得好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"关心对方时，他觉得这份喜欢留在心里也很甜，暂时忘了自己为何盼回应，可那念头过会儿又回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里也很甜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得眼前的亲近就这样过去，却怕它留不住，心里便泛起酸楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"泛起酸楚\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"将抽象的矛盾改成具体的限度：他多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求；同时保留难堪没有削弱喜欢这一事实。沿用上一轮措辞。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"补明中间立场\",\n      \"why\": \"明确他仍盼被珍惜，只是不再反复琢磨对方是否在意，也不强迫自己变成什么都不求的人；同时保留把心思放回当下、真心关心对方的行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\", \"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并保留上一轮结果\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留独自珍藏喜欢的甜意，以及舍不得亲近、又怕它留不住的酸楚。甜意只是暂时让回应的念头退开，并未消除期待，为后段喜欢加深、变得难以收放留下依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "082e9afa-d596-4539-93bf-a7dcc4870071", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223900080776Z", "elapsed_seconds": 311.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:44:11.995026+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7c3b184380bca0106dd62eec910dac0499f79f767afb0e99749bdeb848b3db9a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223900080776Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1e0e6e592c9fdc8376116b86f5744d39ffc6dca535f0e7625a5daa3493d5172c"}}}
